[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1501.59, "timestamp": "00:25:01", "text": "，[笑]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1504.39, "timestamp": "00:25:04", "text": "我想念以前騎著我的踏板車，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1514.39, "timestamp": "00:25:14", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1516.23, "timestamp": "00:25:16", "text": "最後一次談話是什麼時候？你在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1518.95, "timestamp": "00:25:18", "text": "說什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1520.63, "timestamp": "00:25:20", "text": "所以，為了我的記憶，我應該"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1521.929, "timestamp": "00:25:21", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "noice"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1522.87, "timestamp": "00:25:22", "text": "在24號之後把你忘記並取消關注嗎？不，我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1529.669, "timestamp": "00:25:29", "text": "24號之後我就不能直播了。我也會繼續"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1532.63, "timestamp": "00:25:32", "text": "製作類似的影片。 [嗤笑] 所以，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1535.029, "timestamp": "00:25:35", "text": "啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1537.19, "timestamp": "00:25:37", "text": "只要你想，只要我有空"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1538.619, "timestamp": "00:25:38", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "time moves fast"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1539.029, "timestamp": "00:25:39", "text": "，我就會過來。是的。當然可以。  當然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1542.63, "timestamp": "00:25:42", "text": "[嗤笑]呃，[嘆氣]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1545.269, "timestamp": "00:25:45", "text": "暴露你的身分。沒有。絕不。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1553.83, "timestamp": "00:25:53", "text": "好的。我當時在做什麼？對，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1558.149, "timestamp": "00:25:58", "text": "就是聊天室。讓我來設定一下。時光"}]